creatures:
- name: Ghoul
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 12  
      **Hit Points** 22 (rollable(dice=5d8,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Initiative) (12)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=7)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Damage Immunities** poison  
      **Condition Immunities** charmed, exhaustion, poisoned  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 10  
      **Languages** Common  
      **Challenge** 1 (200 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The ghoul makes two Bite attacks.

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d6+2,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=1d6,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Necrotic damage.

      ***Claw.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Claw]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d4+2,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Slashing damage. If the target is a creature that isn't an Undead or elf, it is subjected to the following effect. *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 10. *Failure:* The target has the ***Paralyzed*** condition until the end of its next turn.

